OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787093266
OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,FCharles Spencer is set to publish a
OL,7,Fbook about the life of his sister,
OL,8,FDiana, Princess of Wales, which
OL,9,Fcontains "revelations that will draw
OL,10,Fconsiderable attention".
OL,12,FSwan Song: Diana, My Sister will mark
OL,13,Fthe first time that Earl Spencer, 62,
OL,14,Fhas spoken at length about his
OL,15,Fsibling, three decades after her death.
OL,17,FSpeaking about the book, he said:
OL,18,F"With the 30th anniversary of Diana's
OL,19,Ftragic death on the skyline, I've been
OL,20,Finundated yet again with requests for
OL,21,Finterviews about my sister.
OL,26,@qD@JOUrD@WO]zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787093266
OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,F"This has convinced me to write down
OL,7,Fmy own thoughts and memories, once and
OL,8,Ffor all, rather than having the
OL,9,Fdiscomfort of again reading the
OL,10,Fopinions of others, many of which are
OL,11,Fbased on untruths that have become
OL,12,Faccepted over time.
OL,14,F"The aim of this book is to tell the
OL,15,Ftruth about Diana from her brother's
OL,16,Fperspective, just as I attempted to do
OL,17,Fwhen speaking at her funeral.
OL,19,F"As with my eulogy, I want to speak on
OL,20,FDiana's behalf and do so in an openly
OL,21,Fpositive way.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787093266
OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,F"I hope this book will be of interest
OL,7,Fto the many who still cherish the
OL,8,Fmemory of Diana when she was alive,
OL,9,Fand I would be delighted if those too
OL,10,Fyoung to remember her in her heyday
OL,11,Ffeel ` after reading this ` that they
OL,12,F'get' who she really was: a one-off
OL,13,Fdynamic character, full of love,
OL,14,Fcharisma and self-doubt, who gave life
OL,15,Fa hell of a go, and left the world a
OL,16,Fbetter place, despite exiting the
OL,17,Fstage while still so young."
OL,26,@nD@AOUyD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
