OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,FDaniel Bunyard, publishing director at
OL,7,FPenguin Random House UK, added: "This
OL,8,Fis a book of historic importance,
OL,9,Ftelling as it does the story of one of
OL,10,Fthe 20th century's most iconic and
OL,11,Fculturally significant figures, but it
OL,12,Fis also utterly unique in being
OL,13,Fwritten by Earl Spencer, from a
OL,14,Fvantage point of such intimacy.
OL,16,F"Charles Spencer is both a loving
OL,17,Fbrother and an acclaimed memoirist as
OL,18,Fwell as a celebrated historian, and
OL,19,Fall these facets are brought together
OL,20,Fin Swan Song.
OL,26,@oD@aOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787093266
OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,F"It is extraordinarily moving,
OL,7,Fbeautifully written and remarkably
OL,8,Fcandid, in no small part due to
OL,9,FCharles' rare ability to access great
OL,10,Femotional depth without
OL,11,Fsentimentality, honest observation
OL,12,Fwithout rancour, and warmth without
OL,13,Fgloss.
OL,15,F"While these pages contain many
OL,16,Frevelations that will draw
OL,17,Fconsiderable attention, readers will
OL,18,Ffind, for the first time, but also for
OL,19,Fall time, a fitting tribute to the
OL,20,Fbeloved woman who was Princess Diana."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU|D@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
