OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,FBorn into the aristocratic Spencer
OL,7,Ffamily in 1961, Diana married the
OL,8,FKing, then Prince of Wales, in 1981
OL,9,Fand had sons William and Harry. The
OL,10,Fcouple divorced in 1996.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FShe died in August 1997 in a car crash
OL,18,Fin Paris at the age of 36. Her
OL,19,Fpartner, Dodi Fayed, and their
OL,20,Fchauffeur Henri Paul also died in the
OL,21,Fcrash.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
