OL,3,CEarl Spencer to publish book about his
OL,4,Csister Diana, Princess of Wales
OL,6,FHer death led to widespread public
OL,7,Fmourning and her funeral was watched
OL,8,Fby more than two billion people
OL,9,Fworldwide.
OL,11,FDuring Diana's funeral in 1997, Earl
OL,12,FSpencer delivered a passionate eulogy
OL,13,Fin which he pointedly referred to his
OL,14,Fsister's "blood family".
OL,16,FSwan Song: Diana, My Sister will be
OL,17,Fpublished on September 22.
OL,26,@vD@JOUvD@WO]
